# Shorts script craft (jobs)

- Hook **0–3 s** (hard max 5 s): question / bold claim / news line. No greetings.
- Structure: Hook → Intrigue → Climax → Abrupt resolution → short CTA.
- Voice always ElevenLabs **eleven_v3** + brandbook Nikita / NIKITA2, language **ru**.
- Visuals must track VO (`segment_ref`); no repeated assets across slots.
- News: research first (`jobs/<id>/research.json`); avatar ~40–50% on-screen; top tablets for facts.
- Full skill: `.cursor/skills/youtube-shorts-author/SKILL.md`
